{
  "//": [
    "Shepherdr's features list (3.1.0): every feature the layout ships, on both sides. Each has its shared logic",
    "(core/<name>.js), its Herdr side (the mods it lives in, or a Herdr built-in) and its web side (web/src/screens/",
    "<Screen>.tsx), plus its native form per device. test/test_repo.py checks it: a feature missing a side, a mod or",
    "web screen that belongs to no feature, or a listed file that isn't there fails CI. \"planned\": true marks one",
    "whose web side is still being built (3.1.0's phases); none may be left when 3.1.0 ships.",
    "addon: the add-on in lib/addons.json; off there means off on both sides. view_only: per-device look, no core."
